{"product_id":"god-has-ninety-nine-names-reporting-from-a-militant-middle-east","title":"God Has Ninety-Nine Names: Reporting from a Militant Middle East","description":"\u003cp\u003eA FIRST-HAND ACCOUNT OF THE STRUGGLE FOR POWER IN TODAY'S MIDDLE EASTGod Has Ninety-Nine Names is a gripping, authoritative account of the epic battle between modernity and militant Islam that is is reshaping the Middle East.Judith Miller, a reporter who has covered the Middle east for twenty years, takes us inside the militant Islamic movements in ten countries: Egypt, Saudi Arabia, Sudan, Algeria, Libya, Lebanon, Syria, Jordan, Isreal and Iran. She shows that just as there is no unified Arab world, so there is no single Islam: The movements are as different as the countries in which they are rooted.Vivid and comprehensive, Miller's first-and report reveals the meaning of the tumultuous events that will continue to affect the prospects for Arab-Isreali peace and the potential for terrorism worlwide.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 156 x 235\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Judith Miller\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780684832289\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 576\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45879000301721,"sku":"13RC9780684832289","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/6911b92f1dae3_God_Has_Ninety-Nine_Names_Reporting_from_a_Militant_Middle_East.jpg?v=1762792734","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/god-has-ninety-nine-names-reporting-from-a-militant-middle-east","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}